# Constants

Put tunable numbers and strings in `src/constants.ts`. Group them by feature. Start each group with a `// MARK:` comment so the outline can jump to it. Prefix names so they still read clearly in that file (`HAZARD_SPAWN_INTERVAL`, not `interval`).

`constants.ts` is for tuning, not for every `const`:

- Message schemas stay in `src/networking/messages.ts`
- ECS components stay next to the systems that define them
- Authored data stays in the domain that owns it

```ts
// ❌ BAD — magic number beside the system that uses it
const holdSeconds = 1.5

// ✅ GOOD — src/constants.ts
// MARK: Repair
export const BREACH_REPAIR_HOLD_LEVEL_1_SECONDS = 1.5
```
